<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore May official reserves S$115.18 bln - MAS.</title>
<headline>Singapore May official reserves S$115.18 bln - MAS.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Official foreign reserves</p>
<p>(billions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>					    May 97   April 97   May 96</p>
<p>    Total official reserves	 115.18    114.31    101.20</p>
<p>Gold and foreign exchange</p>
<p>    reserves			    114.52    113.65    100.53</p>
<p>    Special drawing rights (million)  253.50    244.60    240.40</p>
<p>    Reserve Position in IMF (million) 409.20    413.90    429.30</p>
